From: Red Locomotive <67845085+redLocomotive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 10:32:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/31] chore: ignore web build artifacts and bundled music

emscripten emits *.wasm beside the autotools targets, and we bundle the re-fetchable 7kaa-music WAVs under data/MUSIC/ (~49MB). Keep both out of git.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitignore | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index b2dcaea..f8537aa 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -99,3 +99,9 @@ doc/main.ind
 tools/bmpicn
 tools/genfont
 tools/icnpack
+.gstack/
+
+# web build (emscripten) artifacts + re-fetchable bundled music (not committed)
+*.wasm
+*.data
+/data/MUSIC/
-- 
